    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d801">

                <pb facs="0838" n="826" xml:id="pg826"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.01/11–1745: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-11-17T17:00:00-05:00">November 17,
                            1945—5 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>10079. Please convey following message to Mr. Bevin: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The President and I spoke with Mr. Attle.<anchor n="40a"
                                xml:id="d801-f1"/> about the need for speed in the joint inquiry
                            regarding Palestine and our view that the Committee should be
                            constituted at once and instructed to report in 120 days. I hope very
                            much you will support this suggestion so as to avoid serious protest
                            here that inquiry will needlessly delay action. Please advise me at once
                            whether you agree to this suggestion as to time. Signed Byrnes.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
